{"seq":2,"slug":"doc-match-consistency-rule","title":"三单对碰一致性规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/three-docs-match/doc-match-consistency-rule","wordCount":2138,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"三单对碰一致性规则\">三单对碰一致性规则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三单齐备之后，系统要回答一个问题：这三条事实说的是不是同一笔交易？回答这个问题的规则不能拍脑袋，因为它同时决定了两类错误——<strong>误拦</strong>（把正常的交易拒绝掉，用户流失）和<strong>漏拦</strong>（把异常的交易放过去，海关退单甚至处罚）。规则设计的目标不是「最严格」，而是「把可自动判定的部分交给机器，把模糊的部分交给人」，并在两者之间划出一条有依据的线。</p>\n<p>一致性规则可以分成三个层次：<strong>强一致</strong>（必须完全相同，无容差）、<strong>容差一致</strong>（允许小范围内的差异）、<strong>弱一致</strong>（只需满足偏序或集合关系）。把每条比对项归入哪一层，是三单规则设计的核心工作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[三单齐备] --&gt; B[强一致: 订单号/订购人/币制]&#10;  B --&gt; C[容差一致: 金额]&#10;  C --&gt; D[弱一致: 时序/明细集合]&#10;  D --&gt; E{全部通过?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[放行进入申报]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[标记不一致类型]&#10;  G --&gt; H[拦截与处置]\">graph TD\n  A[三单齐备] --&gt; B[强一致: 订单号/订购人/币制]\n  B --&gt; C[容差一致: 金额]\n  C --&gt; D[弱一致: 时序/明细集合]\n  D --&gt; E{全部通过?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[放行进入申报]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[标记不一致类型]\n  G --&gt; H[拦截与处置]</pre><h2 id=\"强一致项-必须完全相同\">强一致项：必须完全相同</h2><p>强一致项没有任何容差，差一点都不行。这类字段的共同特征是「标识性」而非「度量性」——它们不是在描述多少，而是在描述是哪一个。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比对项</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>不一致后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单号</td>\n<td>三单均有</td>\n<td>字符串完全相等</td>\n<td>配对失败，属于数据错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订购人证件号</td>\n<td>订单/支付</td>\n<td>哈希后相等（有核实时可放宽）</td>\n<td>触发身份不一致处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币制</td>\n<td>订单/支付</td>\n<td>必须均为 CNY</td>\n<td>海关不接受非人民币申报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商平台备案编码</td>\n<td>订单/运单</td>\n<td>与备案一致</td>\n<td>主体错误，退单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>币制这一项容易被忽略。海关公告明确跨境电子商务零售进口商品的申报币制为人民币，因此系统在生成支付单与订单单时就应拒绝非人民币的交易，而不是等到申报时才发现 (<a href=\"https://kab.sww.sh.gov.cn/gzzt/002010/002010002/20160413/29eec000-9296-4bd4-841c-5496d5eff1f4.html\">上海市商务委：海关总署公告2016年第26号法规解读</a>)。这条规则的实现位置应该在<strong>支付回调</strong>处：非 CNY 的支付直接标记为不可走保税渠道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容差一致项-金额与重量\">容差一致项：金额与重量</h2><p>金额比对不能要求完全相等，因为存在三类合法差异：支付渠道手续费导致实付与订单应付不一致、优惠券分摊方式不同、以及四舍五入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金额比对的正确配对\">金额比对的正确配对</h3><p>金额比对的配对关系需要说清楚，否则会写错规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>订单单 <code>goods_value + freight + insurance</code> 应与订单实付金额一致（同系统内，强一致）。</li>\n<li>支付单 <code>pay_amount</code> 应与订单实付金额一致，容差为 0.01 元（一分钱，吸收舍入差异）。</li>\n<li>支付单 <code>pay_amount</code> <strong>不应</strong>与完税价格直接比对——两者口径不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设订单实付为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{order}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、支付金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{pay}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，容差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>，则金额一致条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_{order} - A_{pay}| \\le \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用整数分来表示金额可以完全消除浮点误差，这是账务系统的基本实践：<strong>金额一律用最小货币单位的整数存储</strong>，<code>1980.00</code> 存为 <code>198000</code>。这样容差就是整数比较，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 金额一致性校验: 全部以&quot;分&quot;为单位比较&#10;SELECT o.order_no,&#10;       o.paid_amount_cents                AS order_cents,&#10;       p.pay_amount_cents                 AS pay_cents,&#10;       p.pay_amount_cents - o.paid_amount_cents AS diff_cents&#10;FROM doc_order o&#10;JOIN doc_payment p ON p.order_no = o.order_no AND p.state = &#39;active&#39;&#10;WHERE o.created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39;&#10;  AND abs(p.pay_amount_cents - o.paid_amount_cents) &gt; 1;  -- 容差 1 分\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 金额一致性校验: 全部以\"分\"为单位比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount_cents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_cents,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pay_amount_cents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pay_cents,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pay_amount_cents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount_cents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff_cents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doc_order o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doc_payment p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pay_amount_cents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount_cents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 容差 1 分</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"重量比对的意义与限度\">重量比对的意义与限度</h3><p>运单的毛重与订单商品净重的关系是「毛重 ≥ 净重 + 包材重」。它可以作为辅助校验——如果毛重显著小于所有商品净重之和，说明运单与订单可能不匹配（贴错单）。但这条规则不能作为主判据，因为包材重量因包装方式浮动很大。工程上把它做成<strong>弱信号</strong>：命中时记录告警但不拦截。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>warn if </mtext><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{warn if } W_{gross} &lt; \\sum w_{item} \\cdot (1 - \\delta_w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">warn if </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的包材抵消比例，通常取 2%–5%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弱一致项-时序与明细\">弱一致项：时序与明细</h2><h3 id=\"时序偏序\">时序偏序</h3><p>正常交易必须满足「下单 ≤ 支付 ≤ 发货」。这里用的是偏序而非严格小于，因为同一秒内完成多步是可能的。判定为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{order} \\le t_{pay} + \\epsilon_t \\quad \\wedge \\quad t_{pay} \\le t_{ship} + \\epsilon_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时钟容差，用于吸收三个系统之间的机器时钟偏差，通常取 60 秒。注意这里的容差方向是<strong>放宽</strong>而非收紧：允许支付时间略早于订单时间（时钟偏差），但如果早得离谱（如早一小时），那就是另一个信号——可能是重放的旧支付单。时间戳本身必须带时区偏移而不是裸本地时间，否则跨时区部署时偏序判断会系统性出错；标准做法见 <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339.txt\">RFC 3339: Date and Time on the Internet: Timestamps</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[读三单时间戳] --&gt; B[&quot;t_order ≤ t_pay + 60s ?&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| X[时序异常: 支付早于下单过多]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;t_pay ≤ t_ship + 60s ?&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| Y[时序异常: 发货早于支付]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[时序通过]&#10;  A --&gt; E{时间跨度 &gt; 24h ?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[弱告警: 交易周期过长]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| D\">flowchart TD\n  A[读三单时间戳] --&gt; B[\"t_order ≤ t_pay + 60s ?\"]\n  B --&gt;|否| X[时序异常: 支付早于下单过多]\n  B --&gt;|是| C[\"t_pay ≤ t_ship + 60s ?\"]\n  C --&gt;|否| Y[时序异常: 发货早于支付]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[时序通过]\n  A --&gt; E{时间跨度 &gt; 24h ?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[弱告警: 交易周期过长]\n  E --&gt;|否| D</pre><h3 id=\"明细集合关系\">明细集合关系</h3><p>明细比对要求「运单的明细集合 ⊆ 订单的明细集合」——运单对应的是实际出库的货，可能少于订单（缺货分批发），但不应包含订单里没有的货。用集合语言表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{waybill} \\subseteq S_{order}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中集合元素是 <code>(hs_code, qty)</code> 二元组，比对的语义是：对每个税号，运单数量 ≤ 订单数量。</p>\n<p>分批发货是这条规则的重要例外。一个订单可能拆成多个运单，每个运单是订单明细的真子集，此时<strong>不能要求单张运单等于整个订单</strong>，而应校验所有运单的数量之和不超过订单数量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>:</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall h: \\sum_{w \\in W_{order}} qty(h, w) \\le qty(h, order)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4502em;vertical-align:-1.4002em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4002em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个从「单张运单匹配」到「运单集合聚合匹配」的转变，是分批发货场景下最容易被写错的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性的总判定与分级\">一致性的总判定与分级</h2><p>把上面各层规则组合成一个判定流程，输出不应只有「一致/不一致」两值，而应分级，因为不同级别对应不同的处置成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>命中项</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 完全一致</td>\n<td>全部通过</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>直接进入申报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 告警一致</td>\n<td>仅弱信号命中</td>\n<td>重量、时序偏长</td>\n<td>记录告警，继续申报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 可修复不一致</td>\n<td>金额超容差但可解释</td>\n<td>手续费、优惠分摊</td>\n<td>人工确认后继续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 硬不一致</td>\n<td>强一致项失败</td>\n<td>订单号、订购人、币制</td>\n<td>拦截，不允许申报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分级的价值在于<strong>把人工介入限制在 L2</strong>。L1 不该打扰人，L3 不需要人判断（机器能确定），只有 L2 需要人看一眼。如果系统把 L1 也拦下来，运营会被告警淹没，最终对所有告警脱敏——这是安全系统里最典型的失效模式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定结果的落库形态\">判定结果的落库形态</h3><p>判定结果必须持久化，因为它是后续处置的依据，也是争议时的取证材料。落库时应保存命中的具体比对项与两侧的原始值，而不只是「通过/不通过」这个结论。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE match_result (&#10;  match_id      BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_no      VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  level         VARCHAR(4)  NOT NULL,   -- L0 | L1 | L2 | L3&#10;  checked_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  rule_version  VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- 判定规则版本, 便于回溯口径变化&#10;  findings      JSONB       NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;[]&#39;::jsonb&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_match_order ON match_result(order_no, checked_at DESC);&#10;&#10;-- findings 元素形如:&#10;-- {&quot;rule&quot;:&quot;amount_tolerance&quot;,&quot;expected&quot;:198000,&quot;actual&quot;:197999,&quot;delta&quot;:1,&quot;layer&quot;:&quot;tolerance&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> match_result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  match_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_no      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- L0 | L1 | L2 | L3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  checked_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定规则版本, 便于回溯口径变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  findings      JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_match_order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> match_result(order_no, checked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- findings 元素形如:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"rule\":\"amount_tolerance\",\"expected\":198000,\"actual\":197999,\"delta\":1,\"layer\":\"tolerance\"}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rule_version</code> 这个字段常被忽略但很重要：一致性规则本身会演进（容差从 1 分改到 5 分、时序容差从 60 秒改到 120 秒），当事后复查一笔历史订单为何被判为 L2 时，必须知道<strong>当时用的是哪一版规则</strong>。没有这个字段，规则一改，历史判定就变成了无法解释的黑盒。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定与申报的衔接\">判定与申报的衔接</h3><p>判定出 L0/L1 的订单可以直接进入申报队列；L2 进入人工队列等待确认；L3 进入取消流程。这个分流应在判定事务内完成，把订单状态一并更新，避免判定与分流之间出现窗口期——在窗口期内订单既没被拦截也没被放行，用户重试会看到歧义状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性规则分三层：强一致（标识性字段）、容差一致（金额/重量）、弱一致（时序/明细集合）。</li>\n<li>强一致项包括订单号、订购人证件号、币制、备案编码；币制应在支付回调处就拦截非人民币交易。</li>\n<li>金额统一用整数分比较，容差 1 分；支付单金额比对的是订单实付而非完税价格。</li>\n<li>时序用偏序加时钟容差，容差方向是放宽，但过早的时间戳应作为独立信号处理。</li>\n<li>明细比对在分批发货场景下必须从「单张运单匹配」改为「运单集合聚合不超过订单」。</li>\n<li>判定结果应分级，把人工介入严格限制在「可修复不一致」这一层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一致性规则判定的输入来自三单数据模型，见 <a href=\"order-payment-logistics-doc\">订单单/支付单/运单数据模型</a>；判定为不一致后的拦截与恢复路径，见 <a href=\"mismatch-intercept-handle\">不一致拦截与异常处置</a>；而通过判定的交易如何变成申报清单，见 <a href=\"../customs-declare-receipt/manifest-declare-api\">清单申报接口与报文</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三单对碰一致性规则","id":"三单对碰一致性规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"强一致项：必须完全相同","id":"强一致项-必须完全相同"},{"level":2,"text":"容差一致项：金额与重量","id":"容差一致项-金额与重量"},{"level":3,"text":"金额比对的正确配对","id":"金额比对的正确配对"},{"level":3,"text":"重量比对的意义与限度","id":"重量比对的意义与限度"},{"level":2,"text":"弱一致项：时序与明细","id":"弱一致项-时序与明细"},{"level":3,"text":"时序偏序","id":"时序偏序"},{"level":3,"text":"明细集合关系","id":"明细集合关系"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性的总判定与分级","id":"一致性的总判定与分级"},{"level":3,"text":"判定结果的落库形态","id":"判定结果的落库形态"},{"level":3,"text":"判定与申报的衔接","id":"判定与申报的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"订单单/支付单/运单数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/three-docs-match/order-payment-logistics-doc"},"next":{"title":"不一致拦截与异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/three-docs-match/mismatch-intercept-handle"}}